<title>UK: Anglo confirms NEC buys 35 pct of Johnnic.</title>
<headline>Anglo confirms NEC buys 35 pct of Johnnic.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo American Corp of South Africa said the National Empowerment Consortium (NEC) has bought a 35 percent stake in Anglo's Johnnies Industrial Corp (Johnnic).</p>
<p>In a statement issued in London it said the NEC bought 53.1 million shares at 50 rand per share and has an option to acquire a further 9.1 million shares (six percent) for a retail offering.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717.</p>
</text>
